  "note": "The name Damascus and the difficult דְּמֶשֶׁק in Amos 3:12 have different consonants. Their index position supplies no derivation from דמע. The precise agricultural product in Exodus 22:28 is uncertain. SEDRA lexeme 728 supplies the Syriac noun."
